div.p:
From the amt of North Bergenhuus shall be chosen five; from that of South
                    Bergenhuus, five; from that of Christian, five; from that of Hedemarken, live;
                    from that of Romsdal, five; from that of Stavanger, five; from that of Yromsö,
                    two; from that of Finmark, two, and from each of the ten other amts in the
                    country four representatives.
